{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08887","headline":"代美人愁镜二首 二 · 李白","name":"代美人愁镜二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人赠此盘龙之宝镜，烛我金缕之罗衣。\n时将红袖拂明月，爲惜普照之余晖。\n影中金鹊飞不灭，台下青鸾思独绝。\n藳砧一别若箭弦，去有日，来无年。\n狂风吹却妾心断，玉筯幷堕菱花前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}